{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>上水警署有警員疑自轟身亡。今日（26日）上午近11時，據報一名男警員在警署2樓位置自轟。現場可見，有救護車候命，亦有刑事調查隊人員在內了解。</p><p>警方表示，今日上午10時54分接報，上水警署有一名男警身亡，毋須送院；事件懷疑與槍械有關，警方正循自殺方向調查。消息稱，涉事男警隸屬交通部。</p><figure><img alt=\"救護車停在警署內。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261126/1202590365975056384810527.jpeg/G_JkwmOBFaHG8ZMryGuRJ7sViSjxIhnoeEvJqnhLyao\"/><figcaption>救護車停在警署內。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"刑事調查隊到場。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261126/1202592670476668928250416.jpeg/edRJ7bDzcNmr-tCnnyQ5K728nryH36L98Scu3_EnLt8\"/><figcaption>刑事調查隊到場。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場是上水警署暨新界北交通部報案室。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261126/1202590768145895424025741.jpeg/nulYw6Pkv_uEyrBANzdmmBHvaoLvQukmPzwNEj88DRI\"/><figcaption>現場是上水警署暨新界北交通部報案室。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"救護車在場候命。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261126/1202600464831483904458960.jpeg/-lyGdB3LVjsf-w6UJC7VysF8oCBIQ50JataDHUDWgx0\"/><figcaption>救護車在場候命。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"救護車事後離場。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261126/1202600376017096704560983.jpeg/l-Ltr1Vl3GVNAwzOgwaqI0HzgaO0uj0tOpelMhCXpTI\"/><figcaption>救護車事後離場。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方在場調查。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261126/1202591658311421952516294.jpeg/AI5aBNOmpkJbKTNSY_A2ywhR_GJGQw-THAtQ4BwLUOA\"/><figcaption>警方在場調查。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場是上水警署暨新界北交通部報案室。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261126/1202590773816856576483091.jpeg/Z04a7bi0aYdYyDoDjyMFZ2xDCT75S_ggxE4iEcROIhE\"/><figcaption>現場是上水警署暨新界北交通部報案室。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防曾到場協助事件。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261126/1202590771136565248603194.jpeg/H1vJK74-nQdBHSg4dDCGh3S5QSXTALGvKbGO4ymxjuM\"/><figcaption>消防曾到場協助事件。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><p>求助網站和熱線：</p><p>即睇3分鐘情緒自救法　呼